<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-23T03:51:45.198Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:51:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Jammu and Kashmir are conducting high-level reviews of winter security and citizen-centric policing, while six militants were killed in recent encounters and senior officials such as the Home Secretary and the IB Director are slated to visit the region. In Manipur, authorities recovered twelve weapons, killed a suspected KCP cadre, and handed over the bodies of villagers killed in an October attack after an agreement, while the state also sent spurious liquor samples to a laboratory for testing following a hooch-related deaths controversy. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOUnB4MWVEeF82UnE4eHl4TVdFOTJhMW1jWE54Y0JMMmFBNGljeUlIUWxOd1pOM3c4N2hqQWVqMXhKZU1EUW42cUFuV0tNY052YzFJREh3Z3pPVEJqR0tKdTFPY3pyUDlZaWVkSXdBUnFPY25lc0VzeVc4THFFWElzTTdOMHhTLTBkYVlwM3VJS2hDQk9BWTBFM3VZcHNnYWItdExnZEtfSVZGd0YwOUNBQ2xR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE9McG1FZVF2RExpNGZMTFNITDZoc1lxbThickU3MzhUa2RXWWM4WTh5QldaUmVwNjNfQVZyQm1Sb1FQUGtzY2NzM1lUUDFBRy10U1d5NWhNXzFWUS16TjNQQ0VhbncyZ2xPdnJQVDI4cTNQUFhPVVE3Z05QZ0ZCeW8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE8yOTkzZ1Q5cHJkVW84cVc3T0xiN1hHVkVmLWFfT0U1S3V4TWZzRFR5bWdQYXlQaE1tOWFpSlRfcmJ1RjNUcnMtLTRFX0FXSUVodi1xLUt6ZUpxNkhhTWVJOGw0eGdBeUhsa01XRVAxUlBCUEJhX3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOYmJEbUZMeHRKbURCRGEzVXJxblVWeTVLMzdXcFNwMW9HaVZCLXoyMy1rRTJFS2lRX09Gcl9FczZxSE1wTnpDUkZUOFBpZ3VTMlBZRDJCcktPT2pNb